{"text":"<p></p><p></p><p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KUKD9FjaHkY</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"0\">00:00</span> ### Dhammapaccanīyānulome dukapaṭṭhānaṃ ^7-72-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1-6. Hetugocchakaṃ ^7-72a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8.424559\">00:08</span> 1. Nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu ca nahetu ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-72a-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"32.02482\">00:32</span> Nanahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nanahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nanahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu ca nahetu ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"54.592669\">00:54</span> Nahetuñca nanahetuñca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nahetuñca nanahetuñca dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nahetuñca nanahetuñca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu ca nahetu ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe nava…pe… avigate nava.</p><p><br /></p><p>(Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"94.152583\">01:34</span> 2. Nasahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko ca ahetuko ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Tīṇi. ^7-72a-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"119.588985\">01:59</span> Naahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Naahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Naahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko ca ahetuko ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"140.888439\">02:20</span> Nasahetukañca naahetukañca dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasahetukañca naahetukañca dhammaṃ paṭicca ahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasahetukañca naahetukañca dhammaṃ paṭicca sahetuko ca ahetuko ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Tīṇi. Hetuyā nava.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"172.133422\">02:52</span> 3. Nahetusampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca hetusampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72a-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"185.666104\">03:05</span> 4. Nahetuñceva naahetukañca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu ceva sahetuko ca dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72a-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"197.388049\">03:17</span> 5. Nahetuñceva nahetuvippayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca hetu ceva hetusampayutto ca dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72a-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"211.099406\">03:31</span> 6. Nahetuṃ nasahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu sahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72a-6</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 7-13. Cūḷantaradukādi ^7-72b-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"222.447726\">03:42</span> 7. Naappaccayaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sappaccayo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuyā ekaṃ. ^7-72b-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"236.198677\">03:56</span> 8. Naasaṅkhataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saṅkhato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Hetuyā ekaṃ. ^7-72b-8</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"244.491176\">04:04</span> 9. Nasanidassanaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sanidassano dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasanidassanaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anidassano dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasanidassanaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sanidassano ca anidassano ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Hetuyā tīṇi. ^7-72b-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"269.548904\">04:29</span> Nasanidassano dhammo sanidassanassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"278.222021\">04:38</span> Nasanidassano dhammo anidassanassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Naanidassano dhammo anidassanassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"298.169892\">04:58</span> 10. Nasappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sappaṭigho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca appaṭigho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sappaṭigho ca appaṭigho ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Tīṇi. ^7-72b-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"325.546816\">05:25</span> Naappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca appaṭigho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Naappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sappaṭigho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Naappaṭighaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sappaṭigho ca appaṭigho ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"349.667883\">05:49</span> Nasappaṭighañca naappaṭighañca dhammaṃ paṭicca sappaṭigho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. Hetuyā nava.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"361.163471\">06:01</span> 11. Narūpiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca rūpī dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72b-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"374.28129\">06:14</span> 12. Nalokiyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca lokiyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nalokiyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca lokuttaro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nalokiyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca lokiyo ca lokuttaro ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-72b-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"395.45102\">06:35</span> Nalokuttaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca lokiyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"402.613897\">06:42</span> Nalokiyañca nalokuttarañca dhammaṃ paṭicca lokiyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1). Hetuyā pañca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"413.567725\">06:53</span> 13. Nakenaci viññeyyaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kenaci viññeyyo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72b-13</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 14-19. Āsavagocchakaṃ ^7-72c-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"424.489429\">07:04</span> 14. Naāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Naāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca noāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Naāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavo ca noāsavo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Tīṇi. ^7-72c-14</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"450.886462\">07:30</span> Nanoāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca noāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nanoāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nanoāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavo ca noāsavo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"468.463492\">07:48</span> Naāsavañca nanoāsavañca dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. Hetuyā nava.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"480.099422\">08:00</span> 15. Nasāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sāsavo ca anāsavo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Tīṇi. ^7-72c-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"501.957405\">08:21</span> Naanāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ekaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"513.836682\">08:33</span> Nasāsavañca naanāsavañca dhammaṃ paṭicca sāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ekaṃ. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) Hetuyā pañca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"524.846213\">08:44</span> 16. Naāsavasampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavasampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72c-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"539.488509\">08:59</span> 17. Naāsavañceva anāsavañca dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavo ceva sāsavo ca dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72c-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"551.273516\">09:11</span> 18. Naāsavañceva naāsavavippayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavo ceva āsavasampayutto ca dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72c-18</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"565.68164\">09:25</span> 19. Āsavavippayuttaṃ nasāsavaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca āsavavippayutto sāsavo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā pañca. ^7-72c-19</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 20-54. Saññojanādichagocchakāni ^7-72d-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"577.670933\">09:37</span> 20. Nasaññojanaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saññojano dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā…pe…. ^7-72d-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"589.348089\">09:49</span> Naganthaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca gantho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"594.863163\">09:54</span> Naoghaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ogho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā …pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"601.783995\">10:01</span> Nayogaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca yogo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"607.774798\">10:07</span> Nanīvaraṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nīvaraṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā…</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"614.486115\">10:14</span> 21. Naparāmāsaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca parāmāso dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā…. ^7-72d-21</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 55-68. Mahantaradukādi ^7-72e-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"621.666308\">10:21</span> 22. Nasārammaṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sārammaṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasārammaṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anārammaṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasārammaṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sārammaṇo ca anārammaṇo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Tīṇi. ^7-72e-22</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"645.9988\">10:45</span> Naanārammaṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anārammaṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"654.174548\">10:54</span> Nasārammaṇañca naanārammaṇañca dhammaṃ paṭicca sārammaṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. Hetuyā nava.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"667.09016\">11:07</span> 23. Nacittaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca citto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nacittaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nocitto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nacittaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca citto ca nocitto ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Tīṇi. ^7-72e-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"692.66354\">11:32</span> Nanocittaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nocitto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ekaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"700.757725\">11:40</span> Nacittañca nanocittañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nocitto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ekaṃ. Hetuyā pañca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"711.609278\">11:51</span> 24. Nacetasikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cetasiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nacetasikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca acetasiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nacetasikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cetasiko ca acetasiko ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Hetuyā nava. ^7-72e-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"745.62489\">12:25</span> 25. Nacittasampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nacittasampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittavippayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nacittasampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasampayutto ca cittavippayutto ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-72e-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"772.245946\">12:52</span> Nacittavippayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittavippayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nacittavippayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nacittavippayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasampayutto ca cittavippayutto ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p>Nacittasampayuttañca nacittavippayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasampayutto dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. Hetuyā nava.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"801.167533\">13:21</span> 26. Nacittasaṃsaṭṭhaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasaṃsaṭṭho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nacittasaṃsaṭṭhaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittavisaṃsaṭṭho dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nacittasaṃsaṭṭhaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasaṃsaṭṭho ca cittavisaṃsaṭṭho ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72e-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"835.002144\">13:55</span> 27. Nacittasamuṭṭhānaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasamuṭṭhāno dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nacittasamuṭṭhānaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nocittasamuṭṭhāno dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nacittasamuṭṭhānaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasamuṭṭhāno ca nocittasamuṭṭhāno ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72e-27</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"865.477938\">14:25</span> 28. Nacittasahabhuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasahabhū dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nacittasahabhuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nocittasahabhū dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nacittasahabhuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasahabhū ca nocittasahabhū ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72e-28</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"888.767302\">14:48</span> 29. Nacittānuparivattiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittānuparivattī dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nacittānuparivattiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nocittānuparivattī dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nacittānuparivattiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittānuparivattī ca nocittānuparivattī ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72e-29</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"919.56559\">15:19</span> 30. Nacittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhāno dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72e-30</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"938.740877\">15:38</span> 31. Nacittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānasahabhuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānasahabhū dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72e-31</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"951.459957\">15:51</span> 32. Nacittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānānuparivattiṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānānuparivattī dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72e-32</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"964.895435\">16:04</span> 33. Naajjhattikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca ajjhattiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-72e-33</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"976.916224\">16:16</span> Nabāhiraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca bāhiro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>Naajjhattikañca nabāhirañca dhammaṃ paṭicca ajjhattiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. Hetuyā nava.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"990.557051\">16:30</span> 34. Naupādā dhammaṃ paṭicca upādā dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā pañca. ^7-72e-34</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"998.224387\">16:38</span> 35. Naupādinnaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anupādinno dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā pañca. ^7-72e-35</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 69-74. Upādānagocchakaṃ ^7-72f-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1007.859247\">16:47</span> 36. Naupādānaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādāno dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-72f-36</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 75-82. Kilesagocchakaṃ ^7-72g-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1016.517978\">16:56</span> 37. Nakilesaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kileso dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-72g-37</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 83-99. Piṭṭhidukaṃ ^7-72h-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1024.5846\">17:04</span> 38. Nadassanena pahātabbaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nadassanena pahātabbo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ekaṃ. ^7-72h-38</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1038.38329\">17:18</span> Nanadassanena pahātabbaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca dassanena pahātabbo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nanadassanena pahātabbaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nadassanena pahātabbo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nanadassanena pahātabbaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca dassanena pahātabbo ca nadassanena pahātabbo ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1071.182968\">17:51</span> Nadassanena pahātabbañca nanadassanena pahātabbañca dhammaṃ paṭicca nadassanena pahātabbo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ekaṃ. Hetuyā pañca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1086.925277\">18:06</span> 39. Nabhāvanāya pahātabbaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nabhāvanāya pahātabbo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā pañca. ^7-72h-39</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1101.051461\">18:21</span> 40. Nadassanena pahātabbahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca dassanena pahātabbahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72h-40</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1113.526611\">18:33</span> 41. Nabhāvanāya pahātabbahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca bhāvanāya pahātabbahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72h-41</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1125.518352\">18:45</span> 42. Nasavitakkaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca savitakko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasavitakkaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca avitakko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasavitakkaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca savitakko ca avitakko ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Tīṇi. ^7-72h-42</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1152.866869\">19:12</span> Naavitakkaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca avitakko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Naavitakkaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca savitakko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Naavitakkaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca savitakko ca avitakko ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1174.406423\">19:34</span> Nasavitakkañca naavitakkañca dhammaṃ paṭicca savitakko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasavitakkañca naavitakkañca dhammaṃ paṭicca avitakko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasavitakkañca naavitakkañca dhammaṃ paṭicca savitakko ca avitakko ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) Hetuyā nava.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1201.376291\">20:01</span> 43. Nasavicāraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca savicāro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā … hetuyā nava. ^7-72h-43</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1215.628885\">20:15</span> 44. Nasappītikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sappītiko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72h-44</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1224.281854\">20:24</span> 45. Napītisahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca pītisahagato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72h-45</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1234.499035\">20:34</span> 46. Nasukhasahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sukhasahagato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72h-46</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1244.36004\">20:44</span> 47. Naupekkhāsahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upekkhāsahagato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Naupekkhāsahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca naupekkhāsahagato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Naupekkhāsahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upekkhāsahagato ca naupekkhāsahagato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Tīṇi. ^7-72h-47</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1277.211001\">21:17</span> Nanaupekkhāsahagataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca naupekkhāsahagato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1286.932724\">21:26</span> Naupekkhāsahagatañca nanaupekkhāsahagatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca upekkhāsahagato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Naupekkhāsahagatañca nanaupekkhāsahagatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca naupekkhāsahagato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Naupekkhāsahagatañca nanaupekkhāsahagatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca upekkhāsahagato ca naupekkhāsahagato ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Tīṇi. Hetuyā nava.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1327.334906\">22:07</span> 48. Nakāmāvacaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kāmāvacaro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nakāmāvacaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nakāmāvacaro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nakāmāvacaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kāmāvacaro ca nakāmāvacaro ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-72h-48</p><p><br /></p><p>Nanakāmāvacaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nakāmāvacaro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1365.151339\">22:45</span> Nakāmāvacarañca nanakāmāvacarañca dhammaṃ paṭicca kāmāvacaro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. Hetuyā nava.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1379.163396\">22:59</span> 49. Narūpāvacaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca rūpāvacaro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā nava. ^7-72h-49</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1390.540972\">23:10</span> 50. Naarūpāvacaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca naarūpāvacaro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā pañca. ^7-72h-50</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1399.865518\">23:19</span> 51. Napariyāpannaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca pariyāpanno dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-72h-51</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1407.739183\">23:27</span> Naapariyāpannaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca pariyāpanno dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ekaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1416.537737\">23:36</span> Napariyāpannañca naapariyāpannañca dhammaṃ paṭicca pariyāpanno dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ekaṃ. Hetuyā pañca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1428.973815\">23:48</span> 52. Naniyyānikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca aniyyāniko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ekaṃ. ^7-72h-52</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1437.054583\">23:57</span> Naaniyyānikaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca aniyyāniko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1449.611676\">24:09</span> Naniyyānikañca naaniyyānikañca dhammaṃ paṭicca aniyyāniko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ekaṃ. Hetuyā pañca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1461.599934\">24:21</span> 53. Naniyataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca aniyato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ekaṃ. ^7-72h-53</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1473.256026\">24:33</span> Naaniyataṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca aniyato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1479.906086\">24:39</span> Naniyatañca naaniyatañca dhammaṃ paṭicca aniyato dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ekaṃ. Hetuyā pañca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1490.861071\">24:50</span> 54. Nasauttaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sauttaro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasauttaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anuttaro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Nasauttaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sauttaro ca anuttaro ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. Tīṇi. ^7-72h-54</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1512.487354\">25:12</span> Naanuttaraṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sauttaro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ekaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasauttarañca naanuttarañca dhammaṃ paṭicca sauttaro dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… hetuyā pañca.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 100. Saraṇadukaṃ ^7-72i-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1531.271645\">25:31</span> 55. Nasaraṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ekaṃ. ^7-72i-55</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1541.750408\">25:41</span> Naaraṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>Nasaraṇañca naaraṇañca dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Ekaṃ. Hetuyā pañca, ārammaṇe dve…pe… avigate pañca.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### Paccanīyaṃ ^7-72j-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nahetupaccayo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1562.622842\">26:02</span>  56. Nasaraṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca araṇo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. Naaraṇaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca saraṇo dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-72j-56</p><p><br /></p><p>Nahetuyā dve, naārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… novigate tīṇi.</p><p><br /></p><p>(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1575.265787\">26:15</span> 57. Nasaraṇo dhammo araṇassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-72j-57</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1596.19616\">26:36</span> Naaraṇo dhammo araṇassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. Naaraṇo dhammo saraṇassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. Naaraṇo dhammo saraṇassa ca araṇassa ca dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (3)</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1613.443467\">26:53</span> 58. Nasaraṇo dhammo saraṇassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Nasaraṇo dhammo araṇassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Dve. ^7-72j-58</p><p><br /></p><p>Naaraṇo dhammo araṇassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Naaraṇo dhammo saraṇassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Dve.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1647.782929\">27:27</span> 59. Hetuyā cattāri, ārammaṇe cattāri…pe… avigate satta. ^7-72j-59</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Paccanīyuddhāro</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1653.462249\">27:33</span> 60. Nasaraṇo dhammo saraṇassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo, upanissayapaccayena paccayo, purejātapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-72j-60</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1668.940752\">27:48</span> Nahetuyā satta, naārammaṇe satta…pe… noavigate cattāri.</p><p><br /></p><p>(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.)</p><p><br /></p><p>Dhammapaccanīyānulome dukapaṭṭhānaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p>","media-time":1661.084679}